
This is a non-exhaustive changelog for jomLike component (starting from ver. 1.0.1)

Legend:
  # -> Bug Fix
  + -> Addition
  ^ -> Change
  - -> Removed
  ! -> Note

---------------- 1.0.9 Released -- [DEC 23, 2011] ------------------
^  Changed titles to base64 encoding to work around json_en/decode from not working properly with utf8 chars. -BUR 12/21/2011
+  Added code to allow commenting on activity stream likes in JomSocial 2.4.x. -BUR 12/23/2011

---------------- 1.0.8 Released -- [OCT 17, 2011] ------------------
#  Fixed Joomla! apostrope mangling in titles. Using $_REQUEST instead of JRequest::_getVar -BUR 10/17/2011
+  Added French translation. Thank you Jean-Marie! -BUR 7/19/2011
#  Fixed language file call for jomSocial activity stream plug-in. -BUR 7/19/2011

---------------- 1.0.7 Released -- [July 18, 2011] ------------------
+  Adding support for jomRes -BUR 7/6/2011
^  Changed JomSocial activity stream translation to add present tense verbs for likes in other languages. -BUR 7/18/2011
^  Changed how article URL's are created. —BUR 7/18/2011

---------------- 1.0.6 Released -- [July 1, 2011] ------------------
#  JomSocial link fix for activity stream.
+  Adding var jomLikeVal; to stop IE JS errors from showing up for those two people that may have JS debugging turned on in IE.

---------------- 1.0.5 Released -- [Jun 6, 2011] ------------------
+  Future proofed stream liking to not add to the activity stream for unknown likes from JomSocial.

---------------- 1.0.4 Released -- [May 17, 2011] ------------------
#  Fixed XML for K2 plug-in
+  Added jQuery.noConflict so that multiple versions may run on the same site as jomLike

---------------- 1.0.3 Released -- [May 11, 2011] ------------------
+  Added support for jomSocial activity stream for articles, K2, and jomSocial like buttons
+  Uninstaller removes associated plug-ins.

---------------- 1.0.2 Beta -- [May 9, 2011] ------------------
^  Moved Assets to front end.
+  Added ability to upload any type of image, not just PNG files.
+  Added licensing to all the files.
#  Fixed SQL query to enable all the plug-ins.

---------------- 1.0.1 Beta -- [] ------------------